# state_normalized_dag.py AI Check

- [ ] Treat ReasoningDag as immutable source-of-fact and emit only a sidecar annotation bundle.
- [ ] Require a PASS State Normalizer evaluation bound to the exact normalized bundle hash.
- [ ] Require every normalized occurrence ID to exist in the DAG event index.
- [ ] Preserve DAG topological order in the sidecar annotation order.
- [ ] Reject duplicate per-occurrence axis bindings and schema/hash drift fail-closed.
- [ ] Record zero model/Devin/DB/Solver/file-write side effects.
- [ ] Import no model, Solver, database, network, or subprocess dependency.
